&lt;li&gt;Deep foundational knowledge and applied expertise in machine learning, generative foundation models, and/or complex simulation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive complex, multi-year, cross-functional projects from early conception to global impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience managing and developing senior engineers, staff engineers, and technical leads/managers.&lt;/li&gt;
