&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Capital on Tap 👋&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💳 Capital on Tap started because small businesses were underserved. Big banks were slow, their products weren&#39;t fit for purpose, and small business owners often couldn&#39;t access what they needed. We set out to fix that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Today we&#39;re a financial platform - not just a credit card company. We offer a best-in-class business credit card, SME-focused spend management platform, a savings product that hit £1 billion in funds within its first year, and a growing suite of tools and financial products that make running a small business easier.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;1,000+ employees, £20bn in annual card spend, 200,000+ customers, 17,000+ Trustpilot reviews averaging 4.7 stars, and we&#39;re profitable. We’ve done a pretty good job so far, but we’re just getting started!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We empower you to be innovative and solve complex problems. This is a leadership role where you will have immediate ability (and expectation) to take ownership and make an impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🏡🏢This role is based in our Moorgate (London) office. You will be in the office at least 3 days per week, preferably 4, and will need to occasionally travel to our offices across Brighton, Cardiff, and Manchester.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People at Capital on Tap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The People function at Capital on Tap covers People, Talent, and People Ops, and this role reports directly to our CEO. It sits at the heart of our biggest bet: that talent density and an AI-first operating model are what take us from 200,000 customers to 1 million. Your job is to raise the talent level across the business, build the capability to consistently attract and land exceptional people, and help lead our shift to an AI-first organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your mandate is talent density, organisational design, and shaping our unique culture as we shift to an AI-first operating model. You will report directly to our CEO, sit on the Leadership Team, and lead the People, Talent, and People Ops teams. What you will be owning:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Density: &lt;/strong&gt;leading our company efforts to attract and land top-tier talent, building our employer brand, driving exceptional performance across teams, and ensuring we have A-players across all of our key roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerating AI:&lt;/strong&gt; helping drive our organisational efforts to embed AI systems and tools across every team in our business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving excellence in your teams: &lt;/strong&gt;building and driving our People, Talent, and People Ops teams to build the most talent dense business in the UK.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisational Design:&lt;/strong&gt; architecting our people structure and team design around business outcomes in an AI first world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values: &lt;/strong&gt;stewardship of our company culture and values, ensuring they remain the bedrock of the organisation as we scale and evolve with new technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For 🔎&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
