pan style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;🍫 Free drinks and snacks in our offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Check out more of our benefits, values and mission&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capitalontap.com/en/company/careers/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Other Info&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;👍Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.capitalontap.com/en/blog/posts/acing-your-interviews-with-capital-on-tap/&quot;&gt;‘Top Tips’ for interviewing.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;✔️Keep updated on new job opportunities by following us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/capital-on-tap&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;📧Email &lt;a ---------- if you have any questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
